OL,3,GNEWSAFood truck owners 'devastated'
OL,4,Aafter break-ins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree food truck owners in
OL,7,FNottinghamshire say recent break-ins
OL,8,Fhave left them hundreds of pounds out
OL,9,Fof pocket.
OL,11,FEllen Parr, who runs Milo's street food
OL,12,Ftruck in Sutton in Ashfield, said her
OL,13,Fvan had been broken into twice in
OL,14,FNovember, and the damage, lost revenue
OL,15,Fand stolen supplies cost her about
OL,16,F#1,500.
OL,18,FSue Green and Michael Bateson were also
OL,19,Fvictims of break-ins to their food
OL,20,Ftrucks and estimate a combined loss of
OL,21,F#1,000.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
