OL,3,GNEWSAFood truck owners 'devastated'
OL,4,Aafter break-ins
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nottinghamshire Police spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid: "Our officers have been examining
OL,8,Fincidents in three locations in
OL,9,FSutton-in-Ashfield and Mansfield and
OL,10,Fhave been in discussions with the
OL,11,Fvictims."
